081D4AC0 bestiary-entry-update-return

The visible-entry path preserves the final call result in r0. The
ROM table at 086126E0 contains eight non-null update callbacks. Each
returns through r0, as do PaletteTransition_Restart and DisplayEntry_SetAnim.
Animation clear and playback return defined values, and a path with no
call preserves the incoming entry pointer.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

